---
title: "Nursery and Garden Center Management (every other Spring, even years)"
code: "HRT-225"
category: "horticulture"
credits: "3"
prerequisites: []
corequisites: []
---

Covers aspects of nursery management, including culture, plant handling, and facilities layout. Discusses aspects of garden center management, including planning and layout, purchasing, product selection, marketing, merchandising, and display. Lecture 2 hours. Laboratory 2 hours. Total 4 hours per week. Additional course fee applies.
